        "docs/07 O17, O26"
      ],
      "clarify": "Profile rule, not specification text: nothing normative says the relationship DID must differ from the connection DID (docs/07 O26; relationship DIDs unique per VRC is the user's decision, stricter than the specifications). Not gating.",
